This code counts the words that come after the word "robot". When it runs, what is sayac?

```
const metin = "robot right turns . robot right turns . robot left turns ."
const kelimeler = metin.split(" ")
const sayac = {}
for (let i = 0; i < kelimeler.length - 1; i++) {
  if (kelimeler[i] === "robot") {
    const sonraki = kelimeler[i + 1]
    sayac[sonraki] = (sayac[sonraki] || 0) + 1
  }
}
console.log(sayac)
```
